NC Digital builds custom ecommerce websites for Llanelli businesses — online stores fully designed around your brand and built to generate sales. We serve businesses across Llanelli and Carmarthenshire, offering a local team with direct communication and honest pricing.

Ecommerce sites start from **£800**, depending on platform, product count, and the functionality you need.

## Ecommerce platforms for Llanelli businesses

We work across Shopify, WooCommerce, and SureCart, recommending the right fit for your business. Every build is fully custom-designed — no templates, no shortcuts.

**Shopify** — reliable and scalable, ideal for product-based Llanelli businesses wanting a professional store. Custom-designed from scratch so your brand stands out.

**WooCommerce** — built on WordPress, great for businesses already on WordPress or needing bespoke features. Fully custom-designed.

**SureCart** — a modern choice for digital products, subscriptions, and service businesses taking payments online. Custom-designed and lightweight.

## What every build includes

- Fully custom design — built around your brand, not a template
- Mobile-first layout for smartphone shoppers
- Secure checkout and payment gateway integration
- Easy product management — you're in control after launch
- On-page SEO for product and category pages
- Google Analytics and conversion tracking set up from day one

## Reach customers beyond Llanelli

With an online store, your Llanelli business can reach customers across Carmarthenshire, Swansea Bay, South Wales, and across the UK. We build ecommerce sites that are ready to grow alongside your business.

